<Item XName="Ref_Dist_MATLAB" UserName="Ref_Dist_MATLAB" Type="Equation">
<AutoCalc><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></AutoCalc>
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% k PDF using gamma() and besselk() function&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_K_Ref = ( 2 * SizeFactor ) / gamma( ShapeFactor ) * ( ( ( SizeFactor * x ) / 2 ) .^ ShapeFactor ) .* besselk( ShapeFactor-1, SizeFactor * x );&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_K_Ref(1) = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% k PDF using gamma() and besselk() function, another equivalent formula&#x000D;&#x000A;beta = SizeFactor*SizeFactor/2;&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_K_Ref1 = ( ( 2 ^ ( ( 3 - ShapeFactor ) / 2 ) ) * ( beta ^ ( ( ShapeFactor + 1 ) / 2 ) ) ) / gamma( ShapeFactor ) * ( x .^ ShapeFactor ) .* besselk( ShapeFactor-1, SizeFactor * x );&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_K_Ref1(1) = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% k PDF using Rayleigh and Gamma PDF&#x000D;&#x000A;%y = (0:0.1:10)&apos;;&#x000D;&#x000A;y = x;&#x000D;&#x000A;pd = makedist(&apos;Gamma&apos;,ShapeFactor,1/(SizeFactor*SizeFactor/2));&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_Gamma = pdf(pd,y);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_K_Ref2 = zeros(size(x));&#x000D;&#x000A;for ig=2:1:size(y)&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;pd = makedist(&apos;Rayleigh&apos;,sqrt(y(ig)));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;PDF_K_Ref2 = PDF_K_Ref2 + pdf(pd,x) .* PDF_Gamma(ig) * ( y(2) - y(1) );&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% other PDFs using MATLAB pdf() function&#x000D;&#x000A;pd = makedist(&apos;Rayleigh&apos;,VA);&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_RayLeigh_Ref2 = pdf(pd,x);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;pd = makedist(&apos;Lognormal&apos;,log(SizeFactor),Variance);&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_Lognormal_Ref2 = pdf(pd,x);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% only fit when isCoherent == 0&#x000D;&#x000A;pd = makedist(&apos;Weibull&apos;,SizeFactor,ShapeFactor);&#x000D;&#x000A;PDF_Weibull_Ref2 = pdf(pd,x);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
